@startuml
title 企业文件管理系统 - 文件上传时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "浏览器/文件列表页\n(files/List.vue)" as UI
participant "Axios\nrequest.js" as Axios
participant "文件控制器\nFileController" as FileCtrl
participant "文件服务\nFileService" as FileSvc
participant "系统设置服务\nSystemSettingService" as SysSetting
participant "用户服务\nUserService" as UserSvc
database "FileRepository/FolderRepository/UserRepository\n(MySQL)" as DB

User -> UI: 选择文件并点击上传
UI -> Axios: POST /api/files/upload (multipart)\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>\nfile, folderId?
Axios -> FileCtrl: uploadFile(file, folderId)
FileCtrl -> SecurityContextHolder: 获取 username
FileCtrl -> UserSvc: getUserIdByUsername

group 策略与配额校验
FileSvc -> SysSetting: isUploadAllowAll()
alt allowAll=false
  FileSvc -> SysSetting: getAllowedSuffixes()
  alt 后缀不在白名单/未配置
    FileSvc --> FileCtrl: 抛出错误
    FileCtrl --> Axios: 400 { message }
    Axios --> UI: 显示错误
    return
  end
end
FileSvc -> DB: 加载用户并校验剩余配额
alt 配额不足
  FileSvc --> FileCtrl: 抛出 “存储空间不足”
  FileCtrl --> Axios: 400 { message }
  Axios --> UI: 显示错误
  return
end
end

group 保存与记录
FileSvc -> FS: 保存物理文件至 storagePath/user_<uid>
FileSvc -> FileSvc: 计算文件哈希
FileSvc -> DB: 读取目标文件夹(可选)
FileSvc -> DB: 新建文件记录并保存
FileSvc -> DB: 增加用户 quotaUsed
end

FileCtrl --> Axios: 200 { fileId, filename, size, uploadTime }
Axios --> UI: 刷新列表并提示成功

@enduml

